WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.450 --> 00:00:05.649
OK, let's go next to Eduardo from Brooklyn,
Eduardo from Brooklyn.

00:00:05.649 --> 00:00:06.649
You're on the air.

00:00:06.649 --> 00:00:07.649
Hi, David.

00:00:07.649 --> 00:00:09.839
Hi, how are you?

00:00:09.839 --> 00:00:12.669
A good big fan, thanks for doing this.

00:00:12.669 --> 00:00:15.019
Thank you.

00:00:15.019 --> 00:00:20.990
Quick question for you, though, is so is the
vaccines kind of become a little more readily

00:00:20.990 --> 00:00:21.990
available?

00:00:21.990 --> 00:00:27.230
I was wondering, is there going to be sort
of sort of like a like a paperwork that you

00:00:27.230 --> 00:00:32.390
have to show that you've been vaccinated or
some sort of badge or whatever?

00:00:32.390 --> 00:00:37.110
I assume so, yeah, we've already heard so
the airline, Qantas has already said they

00:00:37.110 --> 00:00:42.150
will be requiring a vaccination certificate
after a certain point if you want to fly with

00:00:42.150 --> 00:00:43.150
them.

00:00:43.150 --> 00:00:50.470
Ticketmaster has said they are building infrastructure
so that any any sports or concert venue that

00:00:50.470 --> 00:00:55.740
wants to sell tickets with them will be able
to require a vaccination certificate.

00:00:55.740 --> 00:01:00.260
In some cases, it's a vaccination certificate
or a negative test within, you know, a certain

00:01:00.260 --> 00:01:01.720
amount of time before the event.

00:01:01.720 --> 00:01:11.119
I, I am hopeful that some American Airlines
will say after a certain date you need a vaccination

00:01:11.119 --> 00:01:12.119
certificate.

00:01:12.119 --> 00:01:16.170
I don't know if it will be administered at
the federal or state level.

00:01:16.170 --> 00:01:20.470
There will be people, Eduardo, who will say
this is mandated vaccination.

00:01:20.470 --> 00:01:21.630
And of course, it's not.

00:01:21.630 --> 00:01:27.701
It's only if you choose to avail yourself
of certain private business services, you

00:01:27.701 --> 00:01:29.039
need to be vaccinated.

00:01:29.039 --> 00:01:32.439
And I think it's going to be necessary to
get more people vaccinated.

00:01:32.439 --> 00:01:35.289
40 percent reportedly don't want the vaccine.

00:01:35.289 --> 00:01:36.289
And that's a real problem.

00:01:36.289 --> 00:01:43.079
Do you do you reckon, though, that if like
that can be sort of like extended to sort

00:01:43.079 --> 00:01:49.329
of like a localized situation, like bars and
restaurants and stuff like that?

00:01:49.329 --> 00:01:55.909
It certainly could be, but my instinct is
that, you know, an individual bar or business

00:01:55.909 --> 00:01:58.819
is unlikely to pursue that.

00:01:58.819 --> 00:01:59.819
That's my sense.

00:01:59.819 --> 00:02:08.470
I think it'll be, you know, airlines, maybe
some schools and, you know, employers could

00:02:08.470 --> 00:02:09.470
do it.

00:02:09.470 --> 00:02:14.159
If you're a really big employer, like a Wal-Mart,
for example, you could say, listen, we don't

00:02:14.159 --> 00:02:20.470
want our employees falling ill nor our customers
getting the virus from employees.

00:02:20.470 --> 00:02:24.650
So after a certain date, if you want to work
with us, you need to have a vaccination.

00:02:24.650 --> 00:02:27.340
That's certainly something a private employer
could do.

00:02:27.340 --> 00:02:31.180
I'd be shocked, shocked if, like, individual
restaurants did it.

00:02:31.180 --> 00:02:35.299
Sure, yeah, I mean, for that, we need the
vaccine for us and we need the vaccine first

00:02:35.299 --> 00:02:39.290
and, you know, hopefully we are we are three
weeks from it.

00:02:39.290 --> 00:02:40.290
Fair enough.

00:02:40.290 --> 00:02:41.780
Thanks, David, and keep doing what you do.

00:02:41.780 --> 00:02:44.040
All right, Eduardo from Brooklyn.

00:02:44.040 --> 00:02:46.260
Great questions.

00:02:46.260 --> 00:02:47.260
Vaccine talk.

00:02:47.260 --> 00:02:48.260
Love it.

00:02:48.260 --> 00:02:49.260
Love the vaccine.

00:02:49.260 --> 00:02:50.400
The vaccine is coming.

00:02:50.400 --> 00:04:07.659
And that is you know, that is something we're
all going to have to contend with.

